                        "form": "ажита́циях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ec12be1a-c715-3225-91ae-8ec30128da20",
                        "entry_id": "c8827177-68ee-3d65-8628-0dcb18e073ef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. сильное эмоциональное возбуждение, сопровождаемое чувством тревоги и страха"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "333943f6-ea50-4707-b416-71247e750a73",
                                "sense_id": "ec12be1a-c715-3225-91ae-8ec30128da20",
                                "text": "Но аэронавт, по-прежнему в сильнейшей ажитации и очевидно считая свои дела в Роттердаме поконченными, стал в эту самую минуту готовиться к отъезду."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "27fb0916-6704-38ec-9c90-4bc19dc9046a",
                        "entry_id": "c8827177-68ee-3d65-8628-0dcb18e073ef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "психиатр. сильное эмоциональное возбуждение, двигательное беспокойство, непрестанная потребность в движении, наблюдаемая при многих психических заболеваниях"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "43520cca-003a-491d-a820-226bfe3d5680",
                                "sense_id": "27fb0916-6704-38ec-9c90-4bc19dc9046a",
                                "text": "При лечении шизофренической депрессии и инволюционной меланхолии с признаками ажитации препарат сочетают одновременно с нейролептиками, поскольку он способен вызывать обострения психотической симптоматики."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b220d536-1177-4db3-9dfd-de9f9cef5443",
                        "source_entry_id": "c8827177-68ee-3d65-8628-0dcb18e073ef",
                        "target_lang_word": "agitation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "agitation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45f11b13-324b-33cf-b9f0-6c519f40fc75",
                                        "entry_id": "083d7cf7-aa3e-3237-a4dc-34652faed907",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of agitating, or the state of being agitated; the state of being disrupted with violence, or with irregular action; commotion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19e38504-7fee-4206-b085-0c26403de3c0",
                                                "sense_id": "45f11b13-324b-33cf-b9f0-6c519f40fc75",
                                                "text": "During a storm the sea is in agitation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6df8b746-a391-3ad4-8c62-ed9fbd8e4055",
                                        "entry_id": "083d7cf7-aa3e-3237-a4dc-34652faed907",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A disturbance of personal tranquillity; disturbance of someone's peace of mind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f224137-e01b-47eb-b6b4-df279c8d4e10",
                                                "sense_id": "6df8b746-a391-3ad4-8c62-ed9fbd8e4055",
                                                "text": "She causes great agitation within me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "199181de-0627-3067-ad8d-ef9dd3482c53",
                                        "entry_id": "083d7cf7-aa3e-3237-a4dc-34652faed907",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excitement of public feeling by discussion, appeals, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76027449-751a-412f-9af4-9b50635f5d49",
                                                "sense_id": "199181de-0627-3067-ad8d-ef9dd3482c53",
                                                "text": "the antislavery agitation"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f084cc7b-bbf0-4622-b690-d4e2c4f619f4",
                                                "sense_id": "199181de-0627-3067-ad8d-ef9dd3482c53",
                                                "text": "labor agitation"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa55fd62-f343-4211-9f00-d3dfc1ebc608",
                                                "sense_id": "199181de-0627-3067-ad8d-ef9dd3482c53",
                                                "text": "After this conflict pro-independence agitation temporarily died down."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "536fce46-42d7-4891-9757-ee10fb01487e",
                                                "sense_id": "199181de-0627-3067-ad8d-ef9dd3482c53",
                                                "text": "[…] religious agitations […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f0df31f9-7bba-31bb-a256-0f7c32999e82",
                                        "entry_id": "083d7cf7-aa3e-3237-a4dc-34652faed907",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Examination or consideration of a subject in controversy, or of a plan proposed for adoption; earnest discussion; debate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23f41c97-0320-4413-8e10-51b0677adfde",
                                                "sense_id": "f0df31f9-7bba-31bb-a256-0f7c32999e82",
                                                "text": "[…] a logical agitation of the matter […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9aa232ab-64bd-4165-98d2-aa378bafe95c",
                                                "sense_id": "f0df31f9-7bba-31bb-a256-0f7c32999e82",
                                                "text": "[…] the project now in agitation […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a41a3f9-a85a-3cc3-b27c-42dbb7ca4bfa",
                                        "entry_id": "083d7cf7-aa3e-3237-a4dc-34652faed907",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Putting into motion by shaking or stirring, often to achieve mixing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b7da9af-c1d5-4257-96c4-b0fc6aeb0862",
                        "source_entry_id": "c8827177-68ee-3d65-8628-0dcb18e073ef",
                        "target_lang_word": "agitation",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "agitation",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e6578011-4f3e-3cac-9e23-16d9a3753aea",
                                        "entry_id": "7b6be11d-08c2-3a21-802e-30def8657611",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "État de ce qui est agité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c75379b5-f0b0-3df5-8a96-be1ca8d2837b",
                                        "entry_id": "7b6be11d-08c2-3a21-802e-30def8657611",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mouvement populaire d’opposition ou de rébellion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63758f81-eaa2-47d8-a19f-ad11ccc1b53a",
                                                "sense_id": "c75379b5-f0b0-3df5-8a96-be1ca8d2837b",
                                                "text": "Jusque tout récemment, le Houz seul était resté calme. Mais l’agitation a fini par gagner cette région relativement soumise, d’où les sultans tiraient le plus clair de leurs revenus et où les commerçants européens de la côte ont des intérêts considérables."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25220c20-50cc-4eaa-93bd-f3670494171c",
                                                "sense_id": "c75379b5-f0b0-3df5-8a96-be1ca8d2837b",
                                                "text": "En 1884, le gouvernement ne prévoyait nullement que les syndicats pussent participer à une grande agitation révolutionnaire […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b5ee8ec-6f8b-4d38-bc5c-368a9bebbf4e",
                                                "sense_id": "c75379b5-f0b0-3df5-8a96-be1ca8d2837b",
                                                "text": "Tandis que le Midi, qui a, de tout temps, été un foyer de vie intellectuelle très intense et où les juifs cultivaient toutes les sciences, a été le point de départ d'une agitation antiphilosophique et antiscientifique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53aa3ef4-39cc-4b16-ae52-82021d44f20e",
                                                "sense_id": "c75379b5-f0b0-3df5-8a96-be1ca8d2837b",
                                                "text": "Chez les possédants, l’agitation sociale réveille une vieille hantise particulièrement vivace chez les bourgeois français : la peur de l'ouvrier."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de80dca5-7970-4992-8a76-fbbba4c46f08",
                                                "sense_id": "c75379b5-f0b0-3df5-8a96-be1ca8d2837b",
                                                "text": "Pour la première fois dans l’histoire de la Russie, l’antisémitisme et l’agitation pogromiste furent qualifiés officiellement de crimes, punissables par la mise hors la loi de leurs auteurs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7533bd29-0e51-3c41-b4ed-c90c3764e5c8",
                                        "entry_id": "7b6be11d-08c2-3a21-802e-30def8657611",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "État d’un lieu, d’un milieu, d’une vie caractérisés par des mouvements nombreux et incessants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cea221c-fe2a-4463-a000-50f9610441c9",
                                                "sense_id": "7533bd29-0e51-3c41-b4ed-c90c3764e5c8",
                                                "text": "On croit chercher sincèrement le repos, et l'on ne cherche en effet que l'agitation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4ea2172-36ae-3730-aa95-a1005575a48c",
                                        "entry_id": "7b6be11d-08c2-3a21-802e-30def8657611",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "État d’esprit contraire à celui du repos."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f70442fa-f3fe-4d27-8b0d-9a781dad7f09",
                                                "sense_id": "c4ea2172-36ae-3730-aa95-a1005575a48c",
                                                "text": "L’amour, la haine, le désir, la crainte causent différentes agitations dans l’âme."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
